      "content": "That's an interesting ranking. I'm a little confused by why Kevin is first though. He seems much more 'back-office' or technical compared to Jameson. When you say he has 'presence,' do you mean it's a different kind of presence than what you'd expect from someone like Jameson? \n\nAlso, looking at Marcus, you mentioned he might lack that 'technical financial edge.' Given his experience leads large-scale initiatives, isn't that essentially the same thing as executive leadership? Why does he feel like a lower fit for the 'gravitas' requirement than the other two?",
